{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_147_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，王二月，葬衞定公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"二、三月，乙巳，仲嬰齊卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"此公孫也，其曰仲何也？子由父疏之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"三、癸丑，公會晉侯、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、宋世子成、齊國佐、邾人同盟於戚。晉侯執曹伯，歸於京師。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"以晉侯而斥執曹伯，惡晉侯也。不言之，急辭也。斷在晉侯也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"四、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"五、夏，六月，宋公固卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"六、楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"七、秋，八月，庚辰，葬宋共公。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"月卒日葬，非葬者也。此其言葬何也？以其葬共姬，不可不葬共公也。葬共姬，則其不可不葬共公何也？夫人之義，不可踰君。為賢者崇也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"八、宋華元出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"九、宋華元自晉歸於宋。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"十、宋殺其大夫山。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"十一、宋魚石出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"十二、冬，十有一月，叔孫僑如會晉士燮、齊高無咎、宋華元、衞孫林父、鄭公子鰌、邾人，會吳於鍾離。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"會又會，外之也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"十三、許遷於葉。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_147_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_147","textTraditional":"遷者，猶得其國家以往者也。其地，許復見也。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}